Subject: [PATCH] Scope temporary original Credits scene integration

Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_CREDITS_SCENE explicitly omits unrelated views, material
programs, world/input/movie initialization and later phases in a scene test.
The retained frontend, Credits text/update and rendering decisions stay original.
Normal builds keep the original flow. Native GX declarations/fog argument order
use the canonical host SDK without changing the original requests.

